de','part_number':'PDA36A2", "group": "outcoupler_and_pdh_detection", "part_number": "PDA36A2", "beam": "L1.r.t.t", "distance_mm": 80.0, "at": null, "angle_deg": null, "out_direction_deg": null, "aperture_mm": null, "focal_length_mm": null, "fast_axis_deg": null, "split_ratio": null, "cutoff_nm": null, "reflect": null, "aom_frequency_mhz": null, "aom_efficiency": null, "aom_order": null, "acoustic_velocity_m_s": null, "fiber_mfd_um": null, "transmission": null, "saturation_power_mw": null, "small_signal_gain_db": null, "nl_efficiency_per_w": null}, {"id": "M3", "type": "mirror", "label": "Output dogleg mirror 1 (-y to +x)','part_number':'BB05-E03", "group": "outcoupler_and_pdh_detection", "part_number": "BB05-E03", "beam": "L1.r.t.r", "distance_mm": 65.0, "at": null, "angle_deg": null, "out_direction_deg": 0.0, "aperture_mm": null, "focal_length_mm": null, "fast_axis_deg": null, "split_ratio": null, "cutoff_nm": null, "reflect": null, "aom_frequency_mhz": null, "aom_efficiency": null, "aom_order": null, "acoustic_velocity_m_s": null, "fiber_mfd_um": null, "transmission": null, "saturation_power_mw": null, "small_signal_gain_db": null, "nl_efficiency_per_w": null}, {"id": "M4", "type": "mirror", "label": "Output dogleg mirror 2 (+x to -y)','part_number':'BB05-E03", "group": "outcoupler_and_pdh_detection", "part_number": "BB05-E03", "beam": "L1.r.t.r", "distance_mm": 60.0, "at": null, "angle_deg": null, "out_direction_deg": -90.0, "aperture_mm": null, "focal_length_mm": null, "fast_axis_deg": null, "split_ratio": null, "cutoff_nm": null, "reflect": null, "aom_frequency_mhz": null, "aom_efficiency": null, "aom_order": null, "acoustic_velocity_m_s": null, "fiber_mfd_um": null, "transmission": null, "saturation_power_mw": null, "small_signal_gain_db": null, "nl_efficiency_per_w": null}, {"id": "FC1", "type": "fiber_coupler", "label": "Main output fiber coupler (PM980-XP)','part_number':'PAF2-A4B", "group": "outcoupler_and_pdh_detection", "part_number": "PAF2-A4B", "beam": "L1.r.t.r", "distance_mm": 45.0, "at": null, "angle_deg": null, "out_direction_deg": null, "aperture_mm": null, "focal_length_mm": 4.5, "fast_axis_deg": null, "split_ratio": null, "cutoff_nm": null, "reflect": null, "aom_frequency_mhz": null, "aom_efficiency": null, "aom_order": null, "acoustic_velocity_m_s": null, "fiber_mfd_um": 6.0, "transmission": null, "saturation_power_mw": null, "small_signal_gain_db": null, "nl_efficiency_per_w": null}], "targets": [{"element_id": "PD1", "kind": "min_power_mw", "value": 1.5}, {"element_id": "FC1", "kind": "min_power_mw", "value": 25.0}, {"element_id": "FC1", "kind": "min_coupling", "value": 0.75}, {"element_id": "FC1", "kind": "polarization", "value": "H"}], "notes": "Horizontal resonator PDH injection-locking layout at 1030 nm. Seed L1 (50 mW) passes ISO1 (45 mW) and HWP1 (45 deg -> V) to M1 at (220, 50), folding +y into PBS1 at (220, 170). PBS1 (canonical angle_deg=90, diagonal normal 225 deg) reflects V along -x (180 deg) into the horizontal slave resonator: QWP1 at (175, 170), cat-eye LENS1 (f=100 mm) at (130, 170), and cavity mirror M2 at (30, 170). The cat-eye retro-reflector images the waist back to (330, 170) and double-passing QWP1 rotates V to H, so the returning beam transmits through PBS1 along +x (branch L1.r.t) to the 95% HR out-coupler S1 at (320, 170). S1 transmits 5% leakage (2.25 mW) inline along +x to PD1 at (400, 170) for PDH locking, and reflects 95% (42.75 mW) along -y through dogleg mirrors M3 (320, 105) and M4 (380, 105) into FC1 at (380, 60) with >84% mode-matching (~36 mW coupled, H-polarized)."}, "report": {"passed": true, "score": 99.29804268856508, "checks": [{"id": "no_light", "severity": "info", "message": "BD1 receives no light", "element_id": "BD1", "segment_id": null, "value": null, "limit": null}, {"id": "target", "severity": "info", "message": "met: PD1: 2.250 mW (need \u2265 1.500)", "element_id": "PD1", "segment_id": null, "value": 2.2500000000000018, "limit": 1.5}, {"id": "target", "s